{"messages":[{"text":"🏥 El PSOE-A reprocha a Moreno el convenio que mantiene 117 capellanes católicos en hospitales públicos mientras denuncia «colapso asistencial» en la sanidad andaluza.\n🌶️ Para la Junta, si falta cita médica siempre queda pedir cita divina.","buttons":[{"label":"Abrir en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%8F%A5%20El%20PSOE-A%20reprocha%20a%20Moreno%20el%20convenio%20que%20mantiene%20117%20capellanes%20cat%C3%B3licos%20en%20hospitales%20p%C3%BAblicos%20mientras%20denuncia%20%C2%ABcolapso%20asistencial%C2%BB%20en%20la%20sanidad%20andaluza.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Para%20la%20Junta%2C%20si%20falta%20cita%20m%C3%A9dica%20siempre%20queda%20pedir%20cita%20divina."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 1 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%8F%A5%20El%20PSOE-A%20reprocha%20a%20Moreno%20el%20convenio%20que%20mantiene%20117%20capellanes%20cat%C3%B3licos%20en%20hospitales%20p%C3%BAblicos%20mientras%20denuncia%20%C2%ABcolapso%20asistencial%C2%BB%20en%20la%20sanidad%20andaluza.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Moreno%20no%20encuentra%20m%C3%A9dicos%20suficientes%2C%20pero%20para%20los%20milagros%20ya%20tiene%20plantilla."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 2 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%8F%A5%20El%20PSOE-A%20reprocha%20a%20Moreno%20el%20convenio%20que%20mantiene%20117%20capellanes%20cat%C3%B3licos%20en%20hospitales%20p%C3%BAblicos%20mientras%20denuncia%20%C2%ABcolapso%20asistencial%C2%BB%20en%20la%20sanidad%20andaluza.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20La%20sanidad%20andaluza%20pide%20refuerzos%3B%20la%20Junta%20responde%20con%20117%20l%C3%ADneas%20al%20cielo."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 3 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%8F%A5%20El%20PSOE-A%20reprocha%20a%20Moreno%20el%20convenio%20que%20mantiene%20117%20capellanes%20cat%C3%B3licos%20en%20hospitales%20p%C3%BAblicos%20mientras%20denuncia%20%C2%ABcolapso%20asistencial%C2%BB%20en%20la%20sanidad%20andaluza.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Si%20la%20lista%20de%20espera%